title Headcount Reduction
date 2022-06-03
canonicalUrl https://www.cnbc.com/2022/06/03/heres-the-email-elon-musk-sent-all-tesla-employees-10percent-job-cuts.html

post-header.scroll

Sent to all Tesla employees on June 3, 2022, two days after the return-to-office emails, announcing a 10% cut to salaried headcount.

quote
 To: Everybody
 Subject: Headcount Reduction

quote
 Tesla will be reducing salaried headcount by 10% as we have become overstaffed in many areas. Note this does not apply to anyone actually building cars, battery packs or installing solar. Hourly headcount will increase.

quote
 Elon

Read the email as transcribed by CNBC.
